# Staging dir consumed by session-bridge/deploy_staged_desktop.py. Ignoring it
# also keeps codegraph's file watcher out (its chokidar `ignored` predicate
# reuses the project .gitignore): un-ignored, codegraph holds per-directory
# watch handles on fresh build trees, which block the deploy's staged->LIVE
# rename (WinError 5) and force the robocopy fallback. Proven 2026-08-31.
apps/desktop/release-fixed/
# stage-and-swap Desktop rebuild output (#86443); removed after the swap, but
# a killed build must not leave the checkout dirty
apps/desktop/.staging-*/
